  "statement": "For the nonzero numbers \\(a,\\) \\(b,\\) and \\(c,\\) define \\[(a,b,c)=\\dfrac{a}{b}+\\dfrac{b}{c}+\\dfrac{c}{a}.\\] Find \\((2,12,9).\\)",
